{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/35v2u9","slide":6,"text":"upload() receives one file. JPEG handling posts multipart data and can start the first run. Video handling reserves an uploading record, transfers bounded chunks to Storage, and calls /complete. Interrupted transfers can retain a local session. The UI offers Resume upload, Cancel upload, or Start fresh. refresh() reads durable records. scheduleObservation() polls every 15 seconds and stops when work settles, the page hides, or ten minutes pass. Polling observes server work; it does not execute recognition."}